msgstr ""

#: blocks/admin/DefaultSettings.js:678
msgid "This is the space every icon uses unless its own post chooses another. Flush drops both the gap and the small-icon centring, so the icon’s own edge touches the last character."
msgstr ""

#: blocks/admin/DefaultSettings.js:695
#: blocks/admin/DefaultSettings.js:706
msgid "Respect reduced motion"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/admin/DefaultSettings.js:712
msgid "An animated GIF cannot be paused with CSS. On draws a still frame of that GIF for any reader whose system asks for less motion; off keeps the animation for everyone. Only animated GIFs are affected, and every other icon is drawn exactly as before."
msgstr ""

#: blocks/admin/DefaultSettings.js:721
#: blocks/admin/DefaultSettings.js:738
msgid "Fit icons inside tight cards"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/admin/DefaultSettings.js:744
msgid "Only affects icons inside a card — a widget or homepage section — whose edge hides what leaves it. On draws an icon that would be cut off at a smaller size, down to 8px, so it fits; off draws the icon exactly where you placed it and leaves the card edge to your theme. The title’s words never move either way, and a post’s own title is never affected."
msgstr ""

